ntioned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2024-01-25T19:58:56Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":11601789562,"node_id":"SE_lADOCFbutM59O-sozwAAAAKzhUJ6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/events/11601789562","actor":{"login":"loicmathieu","id":1819009,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTkwMDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1819009?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu","html_url":"https://github.com/loicmathieu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2024-01-25T19:58:56Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/2449780967","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/38405#issuecomment-2449780967","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/38405","id":2449780967,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCFbutM6SBLDn","user":{"login":"loicmathieu","id":1819009,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTkwMDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1819009?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu","html_url":"https://github.com/loicmathieu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-31T12:56:38Z","updated_at":"2024-10-31T12:56:38Z","body":"@anamak9 there are two ways to update entities in MongodDB with Panache:\n\n1. By updating the entity object: you update the field then call `myEntity.update()`. This mandates that you have an instance of your entity at hand (loaded for ex via `findById`).\n2. By using an update query.\n\nHere, you want to do a single update by the ID of a document by using an update query which is more performant if you don't have an instance of your entity but less easy / idiomatic.\n\nMaybe the documentation is not very clear but when you use `MyEntity.update(Document).where(...)` the document must be an [update document](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/tutorial/update-documents/) (something like `{$set: {myField: myValue}}` as this is not very easy to use MongoDB with Panache provides a simplified DSL what is called PanacheQL.\n\nTo fix your example, you can use something like:\n```java\nDocument updDocument = new Document(\"$set\", new Document(\"somefield\", someValue));\nYourMongoEntity.update(updDocument)\n                .where(\"_id = ?1\", new ObjectId(id));\n```\n\nOr in a more simple and Panache idiomatic way:\n```java\nYourMongoEntity.update(\"somefield\", \"someValue\")\n                .where(\"_id = ?1\", new ObjectId(id));\n```\n\nIn this case, Panache will translate the update parameters to a document for you.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/2449780967/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"loicmathieu","id":1819009,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTkwMDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1819009?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu","html_url":"https://github.com/loicmathieu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loicmathieu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":15035116458,"node_id":"MEE_lADOCFbutM59O-sozwAAAAOAKauq","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/events/15035116458","actor":{"login":"anamak9","id":83526432,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNTI2NDMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83526432?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anamak9","html_url":"https://github.com/anamak9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anamak9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anamak9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anamak9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anamak9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url"